# WhyWalk Shipping -- sail the shipmasters' routes instead of skipping them
#
# A WhyWalk module: load it AFTER "00 Core". Its settings sit on Core's
# WhyWalk page, and the passenger is carried by Core's WhyWalkRiderPin and
# posed by Core's ridingAnim.lua. Without Core it still sails; the passenger
# is then carried by teleport and not posed.
#
# REQUIRES UI Toolkit (https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/60303) for the
# destination menu, as Caravans does. Without it the module stands down and
# vanilla ship travel is untouched.

GLOBAL: scripts/WhyWalk/Shipping/shipping_global.lua
PLAYER: scripts/WhyWalk/Shipping/shipping_player.lua
